                  "id": "security-operations-engineer:standard:4.2:2",
                  "text": "Using latest IOCs to search within ingested security telemetry",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "security-operations-engineer:standard:4.2:3",
                  "text": "Measuring the frequency of repetitive alerts to identify and reduce false positives",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
